                                                                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="982" height="99"/>
                                                                        <string key="text">Qualified Electrical Workers must be trained on Electrical Hazards per WAC 296-24 and briefed on this  Energized Work Permit. As Authorized Employees, you are signing that you have reviewed this plan.
A Competent Person must complete this plan and make sure all employees are following safe work practices.</string>
