                                                    <view contentMode="scaleToFill" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="RN3-t0-Bf2">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="1" y="52" width="982" height="140"/>
                                                        <subviews>
                                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="zir-L2-1Ag">
                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="5" width="972" height="64.5"/>
                                                                <string key="text">INSTRUCTIONS: A Competent Person must assess the space by completing the Hazard Analysis, boxes 1-21.   The boxes (1) Potential Hazardous Atmosphere and (1) Air monitoring and Ventilation are always required to be checked for any Confined Space Entry.  If the hazard can be eliminated by selecting the corresponding ELIMINATION method in the white box for hazards 2-14, the space can be entered using Alternate Methods.   The Supervisor may check ALTERNATE METHODS ENTRY and sign the form below.</string>
                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="14"/>
                                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                            </label>
                                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="center" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="8wn-gW-Xvo">
                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="71.5" width="972" height="48.5"/>
                                                                <string key="text">If the hazards cannot be eliminated, and only corresponding CONTROL METHODS (2-14) in the grey boxes are selected, the space    is PERMIT REQUIRED, and the rest of the form must also be completed.  IF ANY HAZARD OR CONTROL IN THE GREY BOX IS CHECKED, THE SPACE PERMIT IS REQUIRED.</string>
                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="14"/>
                                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                            </label>
