                                                            <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="70" id="kLK-Pf-yyS"/>
                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">Authorized employees must be trained on Fall Hazards per WAC 296-880 and briefed on this  Fall Protection Work Plan. As Authorized Employees, you are signing that you have reviewed this plan.
A Competent Person must complete this plan and make sure all employees are following safe work practices.</string>
                                                        <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="17"/>
