                                                    <constraint firstItem="KUb-z9-NVc" firstAttribute="top" secondItem="Tsw-dX-b77" secondAttribute="top" constant="1" id="l8I-Ka-dhz"/>
                                                    <constraint firstItem="lDy-cP-ZQx" firstAttribute="leading" secondItem="Tsw-dX-b77" secondAttribute="leading" constant="1" id="lVW-O8-1Wm"/>
                                                    <constraint firstAttribute="bottom" secondItem="YuC-4G-qwM" secondAttribute="bottom" constant="1" id="riX-9r-kNN"/>
                                                    <constraint firstItem="KUb-z9-NVc" firstAttribute="width" secondItem="Tsw-dX-b77" secondAttribute="width" multiplier="0.203252" id="tNq-ES-SEI"/>
                                                    <constraint firstItem="lDy-cP-ZQx" firstAttribute="top" secondItem="Tsw-dX-b77" secondAttribute="top" constant="1" id="uYq-nI-nRo"/>
                                                    <constraint firstItem="YuC-4G-qwM" firstAttribute="leading" secondItem="KUb-z9-NVc" secondAttribute="trailing" constant="1" id="zSC-25-yl3"/>
                                                </constraints>
                                            </view>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="URH-E4-tWW">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4020.5" width="984" height="129"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Methods for assembly, maintenance, inspection, and disassembly of fall arrest systems: ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">
An employee designated and trained by the employer shall inspect all fall protection equipment before use. The Competent Person designated by the employer must inspect components for deformation, wear, abrasion, or mildew before use. Remove any part of the system from service if there is any damage. All fall protection systems will be designed and inspected by a Competent Person who uses WAC 296-880-40020 for proper installation, use, inspection, and disassembly procedures. Fall arrest systems must have anchor points capable of withstanding a 5000 pound shock load. Free fall may not exceed 6' but must be rigged so the worker will not contact a lower surface if they fall. Generally, employees should not use fall arrest systems unless there is an 18' or greater fall distance. All carabiners and snap hooks must have a 3600 pound gate rating. Fall protection systems will be assembled and maintained according to the manufacturer's instructions when using a manufactured system. </string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0"/>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="2eI-Bg-ZUY">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4169.5" width="984" height="113"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Methods for assembly, maintenance, inspection, and disassembly of fall restraint systems: ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops>
                                                                    <textTab alignment="left" location="206">
                                                                        <options/>
                                                                    </textTab>
                                                                </tabStops>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content" base64-UTF8="YES">
Cg
</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops>
                                                                    <textTab alignment="left" location="206">
                                                                        <options/>
                                                                    </textTab>
                                                                </tabStops>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">Personal fall restraint systems must be rigged to allow the movement of employees only as far as the unprotected sides and edges of the walking/working surface. They must consist of a full body harness securely rigged to restraint lines. Anchors for fall restraint systems must withstand 4 times the intended loads. All components must be compatible. All carabiners and snaphooks must have gates stamped with 3600 pound proof tests. Anchorage points used must be capable of supporting 4x the intended load. Rope grab devices are prohibited for fall restraint applications unless they are part of a fall restraint system designed for the purpose by the manufacturer and used in strict accordance with the manufacturer's recommendations and instructions. Competent persons must meet all requirements in WAC 296-880-40025 for fall restraint systems</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="qvb-JX-Edf">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4302.5" width="984" height="48.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Guardrail systems">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content"> must be 39" to 45" above the work surface at the top rail, have a mid-rail and toe board that is at least 3.5" and high enough to protect materials from falling on workers below, withstand 200 pounds of pressure on the top rail in a downward or outward direction, and be inspected regularly for damaged or missing components. All guardrails must meet the WAC 296-880-40005 specifications. </string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="OAG-N2-cnj">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4371" width="984" height="48.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Holes">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content"> must be covered or protected by a guardrail. Employees must be protected from tripping, stepping, or falling into holes 2" or more in any direction. Covers and hatches for holes must support the maximum potential load but never less than 2x the intended load or twice the maximum axle load of the largest vehicle that would cross it. Covers must be secured to prevent accidental displacement and marked with the words "Cover" or "Hole."</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="482-yM-EWm">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4439.5" width="984" height="64.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Warning Line Systems ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">may be used for work activities on LSO roofs or other walking-working surfaces. Warning line systems must meet WAC 296-880-40040. Note: When work, other than construction work, is performed 15 feet or more from the roof edge, the employer is not required to provide any fall protection, provided the work is both infrequent and temporary, and the employer implements and enforces a work rule prohibiting employees from going within 15 feet of the roof edge without using fall protection. </string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="e8x-cv-Mb2">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4524" width="984" height="48.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="A ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment content="Safety Monitor ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">may only be used for Roofing. If used, the Safety Monitor must meet the definition of WAC 296-880- 40045 and be instantly distinguishable from work crew members. The Safety Monitor (who must be a Competent Person) must not supervise more than 8 exposed workers at one time and must warn employees who are unaware of a fall hazard or are acting in an unsafe manner. </string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="QJl-ct-yAJ">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4592.5" width="984" height="64.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="A ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment content="Safety Watch ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">may be used when one employee does infrequent and temporary work on a roof or surface with a pitch no greater than 4/12 and is at least 6' from the edge of the fall hazard. Only 2 people may be on the roof while using a Safety Watch. One employee will act as the Safety Watch (must be a Competent Person), and the other can perform the work. A Safety Watch System must not be used when weather conditions create additional hazards. The Safety Watch must meet the requirements at WAC 296-880-40050. </string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" usesAttributedText="YES" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="pDU-yh-jou">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="4677" width="984" height="80.5"/>
                                                <attributedString key="attributedText">
                                                    <fragment content="Procedures for handling, storage, and securing tools, equipment, and materials: ">
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica-Bold"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                    <fragment>
                                                        <string key="content">All fall protection equipment must be stored in clean, dry containers. Tools, equipment, and materials at heights must be used and stored so they will not roll or be kicked off an open-sided surface. Extension ladders must be secured at the top if they do not extend 3' past the working surface or when workers are working while on the ladders. Extension ladders shall be secured at the bottom whenever they are used to access another level. While climbing ladders, tools must be transported in pouches or containers that can be carried hands free by the worker or hoisted using a secondary system. No part of a personal fall arrest system, including ropes, may be used to hoist equipment.</string>
                                                        <attributes>
                                                            <color key="NSColor" red="0.0" green="0.0" blue="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="sRGB"/>
                                                            <font key="NSFont" size="14" name="Helvetica"/>
                                                            <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="leftToRight" defaultTabInterval="36" tighteningFactorForTruncation="0.0" allowsDefaultTighteningForTruncation="NO">
                                                                <tabStops/>
                                                            </paragraphStyle>
                                                        </attributes>
                                                    </fragment>
                                                </attributedString>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <stackView opaque="NO" contentMode="scaleToFill" distribution="fillEqually" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="lza-eg-trz">
