                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="982" height="80"/>
                                                                <string key="text">Authorized employees must be trained on Control of Hazardous Energy per WAC 296-803 and briefed on this  Energy Isolation Permit. As Authorized Employees, you are signing that you have reviewed this plan.
A Competent Person must complete this plan and make sure all employees are following safe work practices.</string>
