                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="992" height="80"/>
                                                                <string key="text">Authorized employees must be trained on Trenching Hazards per WAC 296-155-650 and briefed on this  Ground Disturbance Work Plan.  Authorized Employees, you are signing that you have reviewed this plan.
