                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="0.0" width="977" height="104"/>
                                                                <string key="text">All rescue team members must be currently First Aid/CPR certified and must have a first aid kit on site.  A backboard, basket stretcher, ropes, SCBA (if confirmed hazardous atmosphere) and similar equipment must be available if Fire Department rescue team has not been contacted and confirmed available to respond in a reasonable period of time.
Note: Confined Space entry in trenches require a Confined Space Supervisor, Attendant, Entrant, and Rescue Team.</string>
